      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">إِستوزرهُ</span></b>  (tropical:)  <i>He took him,</i> or <i>chose him, as a</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَزِير</span> [or <i>vicegerent</i>]. (K.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُسْتُوزِرَ فُلَانٌ</span>
(tropical:)  <i>Such a one was taken,</i> or <i>chosen, as a</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وزير</span>.
(S, A. *)

